    <briefdescription>
<para>One reading of the manifest, run on the pool. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It holds the results until the message thread applies them.</para>
<para>The job parses and validates the manifest. A valid manifest gives the files child, the roots child, and the timeout of the daemon table. A failed validation gives an empty files child that holds the message, the project roots, and the default timeout. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
